| !MIDISynth: load the sound modules that *MIDIPlay needs.
| It plays through SharedSoundBuffer (needs SharedSound and StreamManager
| too) or, if that can't be loaded, through DigitalRenderer.
| SharedSoundBuffer and StreamManager are by John Duffell and are not
| included with !MIDISynth. See !Help for where to get them.
RMEnsure SharedSound 1.07 IfThere System:Modules.SSound Then RMLoad System:Modules.SSound
RMEnsure StreamManager 0.03 IfThere System:Modules.StreamMan Then RMLoad System:Modules.StreamMan
| Load SharedSoundBuffer only if the two modules it needs are there.
Set MIDISynth$SSB 1
RMEnsure SharedSound 1.07 Set MIDISynth$SSB 0
RMEnsure StreamManager 0.03 Set MIDISynth$SSB 0
If "<MIDISynth$SSB>" = "1" Then RMEnsure SharedSoundBuffer 0.07 IfThere System:Modules.SSBuffer Then RMLoad System:Modules.SSBuffer
Unset MIDISynth$SSB
| No SharedSoundBuffer (or MIDISynth$Output asks for it): DigitalRenderer.
If "<MIDISynth$Output>" = "DigitalRenderer" Then RMEnsure DigitalRenderer 0.55 IfThere System:Modules.DRenderer Then RMLoad System:Modules.DRenderer
RMEnsure SharedSoundBuffer 0.07 RMEnsure DigitalRenderer 0.55 IfThere System:Modules.DRenderer Then RMLoad System:Modules.DRenderer
RMEnsure SharedSoundBuffer 0.07 RMEnsure DigitalRenderer 0.55 Error 0 MIDISynth needs SharedSoundBuffer 0.07 (or DigitalRenderer 0.55). See !MIDISynth.!Help.
